  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the User\'s Request**\n\nI\'m starting by carefully breaking down the user\'s request. It\'s essentially a blueprint for a mobile application, focused on visual fidelity. I\'m focusing on the instruction for hotlinking images for the prototype, which is essential for this initial stage.\n\n\n**Incorporating Interface Details**\n\nI\'m now integrating responsive design and a consistent visual language, as requested. Dark mode is also being added. The details from the uploaded images, including the layout and icons, are being implemented for the \"Bharat Fixed Yield\" screen and its core components.\n\n\n**Developing Financial Screen Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the financial information display. I\'m focusing on the \"Peak Maturity Value\" and its calculation, ensuring the \"Effective Yield\" accurately reflects the compounding interest. I am also incorporating the TDS advisory and the Form 15H guidance. Finally, I\'m integrating the \"Ranked Bank Cards\" with features like interest schedule viewing and comparison.\n\n\n**Expanding Bank Card Details**\n\nI\'m now populating the bank card ranking with more financial institutions, including Finance Bank, HDFC Bank, SBI, Utkarsh SFB, Equitas SFB, ICICI Bank, Punjab National Bank, and Bank of Baroda, along with key details like interest rates, maturity amounts, yields, and credit ratings. I am also incorporating an interactive amortization modal for quarterly breakdowns and a tax optimization tip. I am also integrating a bottom banner for DICGC safety, offering a multi-bank split strategy calculator. Finally, I\'m defining a \'Rate Finder & Calculator\' screen with a stepper process: Input Details, Live Yield Ranker, and Quarterly Schedule.\n\n\n**Defining Rate Finder Screen**\n\nI\'m now designing the \"Rate Finder & Calculator\" screen, focusing on user input. I\'m building out the core deposit parameters with toggle for Fixed Deposit vs Recurring Deposit, principal amount, tenure horizon with quick tiles, and a fine-tuning slider. I\'m also including compounding and interest payout options, and DICGC insurance information. On the right, I\'m integrating demographic intelligence, including depositor age and gender allocation, to personalize yield estimations.\n\n\n**Refining Live Yield Estimator**\n\nI\'m currently refining the \"Live Instant Algorithmic Peak Yield Estimator\" preview card. I\'m focusing on geographical and residency tax implications. I\'m also ensuring the correct calculation of interest and the presentation of statutory notices. I\'m prioritizing the \"Compare Rates\" action, which should link to a live bank leaderboard. Finally, I\'m integrating educational information on the mechanics of term deposits.\n\n\n**Elaborating Financial Data**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Bharat Fixed Yield\" maturity information. I\'m focusing on features such as Effective Interest, Compounding Regime, and Tenure. I am also incorporating an interactive SVG yield trajectory graph for a 3-year breakdown, and a tax strategy engine that includes provisions for Section 194A, Form 15H updates and TDS deductions. Finally, I\'m integrating a comprehensive 12-quarter schedule, regulatory safety information, and V-KYC onboarding.\n\n\n**Adding Navigation Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating the requested \"Open FD with Unity SFB\" button. In addition, I\'m working on the navigation by developing several supporting screens. I\'m focusing on an interactive guide for \"Tax & TDS Guide (15G/15H)\", a safety calculator called \"DICGC Safety Index,\" and a comparison feature referred to as \"Compare Tray/Drawer.\" Furthermore, I\'m designing the \"Instant Online FD Booking Modal\" with a simulated V-KYC flow.\n\n\n**Integrating Bank Logos**\n\nI am now integrating the provided bank logos into the application interface. I\'ve successfully incorporated the Unity SFB and Suryoday SFB logos, and I\'m currently working on adding the HDFC Bank logo. The goal is to provide visual clarity and branding consistency across the application.\n\n\n"
