    thinking: "**Examining Build Components**\n\nI\'ve got a successful build, thankfully! Now I\'m diving into the application\'s core components. I\'m focusing on the Navigation Bar first: its contract, theme toggle and RBI Macro Ticker, and I\'ve started with the logo, which I\'ve specified as the Bharat Fixed Yield logo hot.\n\n\n**Analyzing Navigation Items**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the navigation items. I\'m prioritizing \"Rate Finder & Calculator,\" \"Live Bank Comparisons,\" \"Tax & TDS Guide,\" and \"DICGC Safety Index.\" I\'m determining the best way to present each, focusing on user accessibility and clarity. I\'ve also noted the RBI Repo Rate and DICGC insured macro indicators, which I\'ll be integrating seamlessly. The dark mode toggle will have a smooth transition and I\'m planning for a streamlined sign-in process with user profile management via a modal.\n\n\n**Designing Key Metrics**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the Active Persona bar and the four Key Metric Cards. I\'ve defined the content of the Active Persona Bar, and the \"Edit Parameters\" button will transition to the Calculator tab, or open a drawer. I\'ve also worked out the hierarchy of the four Key Metric Cards, including Principal Invested, Max Interest Earnable, Peak Maturity Value, and TDS Impact Advisory, alongside the progress bars and the sparkline.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Bank Data**\n\nI\'m now integrating the live \"34 Scheduled Banks Monitored Daily\" count with a pulsing green indicator. The ranked bank cards are taking shape, with hotlinked logos and accurate data. I\'m focusing on crafting the visual hierarchy and calculating yields, with detailed maturity amounts and risk ratings for each listed bank. I\'m keen to incorporate the \"Highest 3-Year Yield\" and \"Special 3-Yr Tenure\" badges.\n\n\n**Refining Interactive Features**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the interactive elements. The \"View Interest Schedule & TDS Matrix\" on each bank card will smoothly navigate to a detailed screen or open an interactive modal. The \"Compare\" feature is shaping up to allow easy side-by-side comparisons, and \"Invest/Open FD\" will trigger a seamless digital booking modal. I\'m also working on an amortization modal for detailed breakdowns and tax tips. I\'ve also added a DICGC banner.\n\n\n\n**Defining Deposit Parameters**\n\nI\'m now deep in the deposit architecture design. I\'ve defined the fixed deposit (FD) versus recurring deposit (RD) switch and am working on the principal deposit sum with live formatting and preset chips. I\'m also refining the tenure horizon with quick toggle tiles and a fine-tuning range slider. I\'m now working on compounding options and the DICGC callout box. I\'ve also built the demographic intelligence panel with age and gender considerations.\n\n\n**Developing Deposit Insights**\n\nI\'m now integrating an \"ila Samman Savings\" advisory at 7.50%. I\'ve incorporated the state/domicile dropdown and tax residency classification, and I\'m designing a live instant yield estimator preview card. The preview will showcase the algorithmic peak yield, total interest gain, and estimated maturity, all visualized with a sparkline chart. I\'ve also added an alert box for statutory TDS provisions. Finally, the primary action button will transition to the leaderboard upon clicking. I\'m deep diving into mathematical calculations for deposits with compounding and tax-saving aspects. The breadcrumbs, DICGC status chips, and Tenure Inspection screen elements are designed.\n\n\n**Integrating Tax Strategies**\n\nI\'m now integrating the FY 2025-26 tax regime. I\'m focusing on the Bank emblem, the Scheduled Bank tag, and the Senior Citizen Tier with its 0.50% boost. I\'ve added an \"Export PDF / CSV\" button and a Close button. There is a 5-metric key yield ribbon. I\'m also including a visual compounding and yield insight split banner, and a quarter-by-quarter amortization schedule. Finally, I\'m incorporating regulatory safety features and outlining paperless V-KYC requirements.\n\n\n**Designing Bottom Navigation**\n\nI\'m now incorporating a sticky bottom navigation bar. I\'ve included a back button for easy navigation, and I\'m designing a visual indicator for the guaranteed maturity corpus and a primary call to action for \"Open FD with Unity SFB.\" I\'m also including all 15G and 15H information. The tax screens have an interactive eligibility checker. I\'m also now adding DICGC safety features.\n\n\n**Implementing Bank Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating the DICGC coverage details, displaying individual bank allocations, rates, and projected maturities. The \"Compare\" feature is active now, with a bottom drawer comparison. I\'m working on the design of the digital FD booking modal now, which is a 3-step paperless onboarding simulation. I\'m focusing on clean, modular architecture with data types for Bank, DepositParams, CompoundingSchedule, and TDSReport. I\'ve also incorporated 12+ real Indian scheduled banks.\n\n\n**Evaluating Code Structures**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the codebase. I\'m focusing on the `src/utils/calculator.ts` file, and I\'ve integrated precise RBI quarterly compounding formulas, and monthly payout discount calculations. I\'m also ensuring the RD maturity calculations and Section 194A TDS schedules are accurate. I\'m ensuring everything is modular and the code is clean, focusing on component integration. I\'m also now designing the data types for Bank, DepositParams, CompoundingSchedule, and TDSReport.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_91274"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"export type DepositType = \'FD\' | \'RD\';\\nexport type CompoundingFrequency = \'quarterly\' | \'monthly\' | \'maturity\';\\nexport type BankCategory = \'sfb\' | \'private\' | \'psu\' | \'taxsaver\' | \'all\';\\nexport type CreditRating = \'AAA\' | \'AA+\' | \'AA\' | \'A+\' | \'A\' | \'Sovereign\';\\n\\nexport interface BankData {\\n  id: string;\\n  rank: number;\\n  name: string;\\n  subTitle: string;\\n  category: \'sfb\' | \'private\' | \'psu\';\\n  badge: string;\\n  categoryTag: string;\\n  ratingAgency: \'CRISIL\' | \'CARE\' | \'ICRA\' | \'Sovereign\';\\n  rating: string;\\n  baseRate: number; // For general citizen, e.g. 8.15\\n  seniorBonus: number; // e.g. 0.50\\n  superSeniorBonus: number; // e.g. 0.75\\n  logoUrl: string;\\n  minDeposit: number;\\n  tenureYears: number;\\n  tenureMonths: number;\\n  specialTenure?: string;\\n  dicgcCovered: boolean;\\n  notes: string;\\n  exitPenalty: string;\\n  lockInDays: number;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface UserPersona {\\n  depositType: DepositType;\\n  principal: number;\\n  tenureMonths: number;\\n  compounding: CompoundingFrequency;\\n  age: number;\\n  gender: \'female\' | \'male\' | \'other\';\\n  state: string;\\n  residency: \'resident\' | \'nri\';\\n  panLinked: boolean;\\n  form15HSubmitted: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface QuarterData {\\n  quarter: number;\\n  label: string;\\n  date: string;\\n  openingBalance: number;\\n  interestEarned: number;\\n  cumulativeInterest: number;\\n  closingBalance: number;\\n  tdsAmount: number;\\n  tdsStatus: string;\\n  fyLabel?: string;\\n  isFyEnd?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface CalculationResult {\\n  appliedRate: number;\\n  effectiveAnnualYield: number;\\n  maturityAmount: number;\\n  totalInterest: number;\\n  annualInterestFY1: number;\\n  annualInterestFY2: number;\\n  annualInterestFY3: number;\\n  estimatedTdsYear3: number;\\n  netMaturityWithTds: number;\\n  quarters: QuarterData[];\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"De