  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the **Bharat Fixed Yield** application based on your design mockups and specifications.\n\n### Key Screens & Features Implemented\n\n1. **Live Bank Comparisons (Scheduled Bank Leaderboard)**:\n   - **Active Persona Banner**: Displays depositor details (`Senior Citizen (Age 62) \342\200\242 \342\202\2715,00,000 Principal \342\200\242 3 Years (36 Mo) \342\200\242 Quarterly Compounding \342\200\242 Maharashtra Jurisdiction`) with an **Edit Parameters** button to jump into the calculation engine.\n   - **4 Key Metric Cards**:\n     - *Principal Invested*: \342\202\2715,00,000 with 100% DICGC insurable allocation.\n     - *Max Interest Earnable*: Peak \342\202\2711,47,150 (+0.50% Senior bonus).\n     - *Peak Maturity Value*: \342\202\2716,47,150 with effective yield (9.81%) and SVG compounding trendline.\n     - *TDS Impact Advisory (Sec 194A)*: Form 15H guidance notice.\n   - **Category Filters & Sub-filters**: Tabs for *Highest Return (SFBs)*, *Top Scheduled Commercial (HDFC/ICICI)*, *Public Sector Giants (SBI/PNB/BoB)*, and *Tax Saver (5-Yr 80C)*, paired with Min Rating, DICGC Only, and payout options.\n   - **Ranked Bank Cards**: Unity Small Finance Bank (#1), Suryoday Small Finance Bank (#2), HDFC Bank (#3), State Bank of India (#4), and more with authentic official emblems, CRISIL/CARE ratings, applied rates, maturity totals, and DICGC badges.\n   - **Interactive Amortization Modal**: Detailed quarterly breakdown and tax optimization guidance.\n\n2. **Rate Finder & Calculator**:\n   - **Deposit Architecture**: Toggle between Fixed Deposit (FD) and Recurring Deposit (RD).\n   - **Principal Amount**: Live formatted input (`\342\202\271 5,00,000`) with quick preset chips (\342\202\27150k, \342\202\2711L, \342\202\2715L Insured Max, \342\202\27110L, \342\202\27125L).\n   - **Tenure Horizon**: Quick tenure tiles (1 Year, 2 Years, 3 Years, 5 Years 80C) paired with a fine-tuning slider (6 to 120 months).\n   - **Demographic Intelligence**: Automatic tiering for General (<60), Senior (60\342\200\22379 yrs, +0.50%), and Super Senior (80+ yrs, +0.75%), Mahila Samman gender schemes, state domicile, and residency.\n   - **Algorithmic Peak Yield Card**: Live reactive preview of peak returns, compounding trajectory SVG chart, and TDS alerts.\n   - **Mathematical Mechanics**: Explanatory cards on quarterly compounding, Small Finance Banks, and Section 80C lock-in rules.\n\n3. **Tenure Inspection Screen (Schedule 36M)**:\n   - **Key Parameters Ribbon**: 5-card metric summary for principal, interest, compounding regime, tenure, and maturity.\n   - **3-Year Compounding Acceleration**: Interactive non-linear SVG curve with Q0, Q4, Q8, and Q12 milestones, plus FY1, FY2, and FY3 breakdowns.\n   - **Tax & TDS Strategy Engine**: Live Form 15H toggle that recalculates Year 3 TDS deduction (waives \342\202\2715,398 TDS when enabled) and updates the maturity payout in real-time.\n   - **Comprehensive 12-Quarter Amortization Table**: Exact figures for opening balances, quarterly interest ($P \\times r/400$), cumulative returns, closing balances, and TDS status.\n   - **CSV Export**: Direct download button to export the entire 12-quarter amortization schedule.\n\n4. **Tax & TDS Guide (15G/15H) & DICGC Safety Index**:\n   - **Interactive Form 15G/15H Eligibility Checker**: Real-time evaluation based on age, other income, and interest earnings.\n   - **Multi-Bank Split Optimizer**: Automatically distributes portfolios exceeding \342\202\2715 Lakhs across multiple scheduled banks so that 100% of both principal and accrued interest remain legally protected under the DICGC insurance cap.\n\n5. **Dark Mode & Responsive Motion**:\n   - One-click dark mode toggle in the header with persistent theme styling.\n   - Smooth page transitions using Motion (`motion/react`).\n   - Side-by-side comparative bank drawer and paperless V-KYC instant booking simulation."
    modified_response: "I have built the **Bharat Fixed Yield** application based on your design mockups and specifications.\n\n### Key Screens & Features Implemented\n\n1. **Live Bank Comparisons (Scheduled Bank Leaderboard)**:\n   - **Active Persona Banner**: Displays depositor details (`Senior Citizen (Age 62) \342\200\242 \342\202\2715,00,000 Principal \342\200\242 3 Years (36 Mo) \342\200\242 Quarterly Compounding \342\200\242 Maharashtra Jurisdiction`) with an **Edit Parameters** button to jump into the calculation engine.\n   - **4 Key Metric Cards**:\n     - *Principal Invested*: \342\202\2715,00,000 with 100% DICGC insurable allocation.\n     - *Max Interest Earnable*: Peak \342\202\2711,47,150 (+0.50% Senior bonus).\n     - *Peak Maturity Value*: \342\202\2716,47,150 with effective yield (9.81%) and SVG compounding trendline.\n     - *TDS Impact Advisory (Sec 194A)*: Form 15H guidance notice.\n   - **Category Filters & Sub-filters**: Tabs for *Highest Return (SFBs)*, *Top Scheduled Commercial (HDFC/ICICI)*, *Public Sector Giants (SBI/PNB/BoB)*, and *Tax Saver (5-Yr 80C)*, paired with Min Rating, DICGC Only, and payout options.\n   - **Ranked Bank Cards**: Unity Small Finance Bank (#1), Suryoday Small Finance Bank (#2), HDFC Bank (#3), State Bank of India (#4), and more with authentic official emblems, CRISIL/CARE ratings, applied rates, maturity totals, and DICGC badges.\n   - **Interactive Amortization Modal**: Detailed quarterly breakdown and tax optimization guidance.\n\n2. **Rate Finder & Calculator**:\n   - **Deposit Architecture**: Toggle between Fixed Deposit (FD) and Recurring Deposit (RD).\n   - **Principal Amount**: Live formatted input (`\342\202\271 5,00,000`) with quick preset chips (\342\202\27150k, \342\202\2711L, \342\202\2715L Insured Max, \342\202\27110L, \342\202\27125L).\n   - **Tenure Horizon**: Quick tenure tiles (1 Year, 2 Years, 3 Years, 5 Years 80C) paired with a fine-tuning slider (6 to 120 months).\n   - **Demographic Intelligence**: Automatic tiering for General (<60), Senior (60\342\200\22379 yrs, +0.50%), and Super Senior (80+ yrs, +0.75%), Mahila Samman gender schemes, state domicile, and residency.\n   - **Algorithmic Peak Yield Card**: Live reactive preview of peak returns, compounding trajectory SVG chart, and TDS alerts.\n   - **Mathematical Mechanics**: Explanatory cards on quarterly compounding, Small Finance Banks, and Section 80C lock-in rules.\n\n3. **Tenure Inspection Screen (Schedule 36M)**:\n   - **Key Parameters Ribbon**: 5-card metric summary for principal, interest, compounding regime, tenure, and maturity.\n   - **3-Year Compounding Acceleration**: Interactive non-linear SVG curve with Q0, Q4, Q8, and Q12 milestones, plus FY1, FY2, and FY3 breakdowns.\n   - **Tax & TDS Strategy Engine**: Live Form 15H toggle that recalculates Year 3 TDS deduction (waives \342\202\2715,398 TDS when enabled) and updates the maturity payout in real-time.\n   - **Comprehensive 12-Quarter Amortization Table**: Exact figures for opening balances, quarterly interest ($P \\times r/400$), cumulative returns, closing balances, and TDS status.\n   - **CSV Export**: Direct download button to export the entire 12-quarter amortization schedule.\n\n4. **Tax & TDS Guide (15G/15H) & DICGC Safety Index**:\n   - **Interactive Form 15G/15H Eligibility Checker**: Real-time evaluation based on age, other income, and interest earnings.\n   - **Multi-Bank Split Optimizer**: Automatically distributes portfolios exceeding \342\202\2715 Lakhs across multiple scheduled banks so that 100% of both principal and accrued interest remain legally protected under the DICGC insurance cap.\n\n5. **Dark Mode & Responsive Motion**:\n   - One-click dark mode toggle in the header with persistent theme styling.\n   - Smooth page transitions using Motion (`motion/react`).\n   - Side-by-side comparative bank drawer and paperless V-KYC instant booking simulation."
